{"id":1060202,"chapter_id":1060202,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"时隔多日，你与恩菲尔再次踏入了贝尔芬格美术馆。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"阳光透过玻璃，均匀地洒在一片狼藉的美术馆中，灰尘和碎屑飘荡在空气里，像找不到光源的飞蛾一样。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"还真是毁得彻底啊。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"尽管没有了那些令人迷幻的“魔法”，你还是认出来，这里是展出索西亚的展厅。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"只是不光是索西亚，展厅中所有的艺术品，都被破坏成了碎片。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"你依稀记得恩菲尔说过，这个展厅里陈列的作品，几乎等同于她的成长轨迹。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"我们其实可以最后再来这里……","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"没关系的，我没有你想的那么脆弱。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"“心连悲伤都能融化。”","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"你见过它的。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"嗯，你我都不必哭泣。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"这就对了。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"恩菲尔放下手中的工具，捡起一块碎片，细细端详起来。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"《睡在恐惧下的人》，据说很多人看过之后，都想起了曾经被噩梦折磨得无法入睡的夜晚。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"不过，它现在应该也能好好睡一觉了吧。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"恩菲尔扫开那些不同材质的碎块，将属于这个作品的碎片收集到一处，堆成小堆。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"宛如一个个艺术品沉眠的归宿。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"“沉重积压之下，你我都在“铁框”之中，栏杆看似脆弱纤细，却无法逃出来……”","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"但黑夜过去，铁框也最终断裂……","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"看着恩菲尔在碎片中拼凑自己的艺术品，你感到有些抱歉，递给她一张纸巾，并向恩菲尔道歉。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"content":"抱歉，我是不是有些自作多情了。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"为什么这样认为？","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"我知道你视这些作品如同自己的孩子一般……让你直接面对这样的……这样的状况，还是感觉有些不近人情。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"是我没有考虑好。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"恩菲尔接过你的纸巾，轻轻摇了摇头。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"你不用抱歉，本来就是我要求和你一起来的。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"而且……你也不必为我感到悲伤。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"恩菲尔来到原本展出索西亚的展台前，抬头凝望着，好像索西亚还伫立在那儿一样。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"真空旷啊……","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"就连曾经陪着她的“朋友们”，也都变成了碎片。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"content":"恩菲尔轻轻捡起一块白色的碎片，那曾经是围绕在索西亚身边的小雕塑上的一块，或许是眼睛的部位。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"options":["你想要修复她吗","你以后的作品会更好的"],"style":6,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202032,"trial_step":32,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你想要修复她吗","goto":33},{"text":"你以后的作品会更好的","goto":40}]},{"step":33,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"修复？","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"这些都是你最喜欢的作品吧。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"当然，我相信你之后一定能创作出比这更完美的……","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"但是我知道你很喜欢她。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"恩菲尔笑了笑，没有说话，你以为她还在犹豫，便继续说道。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"content":"我们已经平息了魔女之夜，她不会有问题的。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"反正禁闭者们带回管理局的东西早就五花八门了，多一个雕塑，我想……夜莺会答应的。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202039,"trial_step":39,"next":[46]},{"step":40,"content":"不过，我知道这些都是你最喜欢的作品。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"我们已经平息了魔女之夜，他们不会有问题的。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"反正禁闭者们带回管理局的东西早就五花八门了，多一个雕塑，我想……夜莺会答应的。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"你这是想让我修复他们？","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"你很喜欢他们吧？","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"的确。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"恩菲尔朝你点了点头，拿起了好些碎片。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"可你发现恩菲尔并非在修复索西亚，而是拿着锤与錾，重新雕刻起了什么。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"content":"叮叮当当的声音密集地响起，但你并不觉得吵闹，你挨着展台坐下，静心听着。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"content":"——像是啄壳而出的声音。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"……呼。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"不久后，声音停下，你抬起头来，看到恩菲尔在展台上撑着脸，笑眯眯地往下看着你。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"我还以为你睡着了。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"来看看我的作品，怎么样？","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"content":"她朝你伸出手，像邀请跳舞一般把你带起来。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"而在她的手边，是几个利用残片雕刻出来的小东西。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"这些……是什么？","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"content":"那些破碎的残片，经过恩菲尔的雕琢打磨，变成了一个又一个，像茧一样的东西。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"content":"可是不规则的形状，又让人觉得里面有什么东西正在挣扎。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"艺术残渣罢了。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"它们很独特。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"但其实哪怕是你，也不难看出，这几个小东西确实……远不及恩菲尔之前的所有作品。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"content":"可你不知道如何安慰恩菲尔比较好，只能拿起那些小东西细细端详。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"你看见在每个雕塑的中央，有一颗小小的，心形的印记。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"你也不用这么委婉。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"content":"恩菲尔抬起手，轻轻朝一个雕塑点了点，一个茧应声倒地。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"这些东西……还不如我三年前做的。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"没有……这么夸张吧。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"就是这么夸张。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"恩菲尔环顾这空旷的展厅。只有一地碎片的房间，像是一座密不透风的牢笼，好像拼尽全力也无法挣脱一般，窒息地让人心口作疼。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"但是这也没什么好怕的。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"艺术家……本来就该是这样的。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"我们在创作中挣扎，成长，让自己回归虚无，最终又进化成完整个体。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"content":"恩菲尔张开了双手，蓝色的衣角被她扬起，你仿佛看到了一双透着鳞光的翅膀。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"一次又一次的创作，便是一次又一次地撕裂自己。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"像一次次的破茧一样，最后出现一只让所有人都惊艳的飞蛾。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"然后……","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"content":"她转过头来，微笑着看着你。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"在惊艳了所有人之后，扑向灯火，留给世界一个最完美的残渣。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"这些艺术品……","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"content":"恩菲尔将一块残块交到你手上，那是一块颜色纯净的石膏，断面粗糙，表面却打磨得精细。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"content":"一道道凿刻出来的凹痕线条，就像被风吹过，女子身上的薄纱。而在这之中，也藏着一颗心形的印记。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"这些就是艺术家们蜕下来的茧，或是烧毁后留下来的痕迹……","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"即便破碎不堪，那也是自己存在过的证明。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"只不过……碎片，更容易被世界所遗忘罢了。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"所以……我想要创造一个，让人无法遗忘的，最完美的痕迹。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"content":"碎片在恩菲尔手里碾碎成灰，从指缝间徐徐落下。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"不管是怎样的迷茫拦在我面前……我都会将它们摧毁。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"options":["我相信你。"],"style":6,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202088,"trial_step":88,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我相信你。","goto":89}]},{"step":89,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"哈哈……你真可爱。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"那就谢谢你啦。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"毕竟我已经下定决心，要打碎我的迷茫。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"索西亚已经失败了，我被卡在瓶子之中。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"但这不代表我会继续失败——像打碎索西亚一样，我会找到我软弱的原因，打破这个瓶子，再次破茧。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"无论这个过程有多痛苦。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"不过嘛……","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"content":"恩菲尔拖长了声音，让你有些紧张。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"再不快点整理，今晚我们可就要继续“魔女之夜”了。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"content":"你耸耸肩膀，和恩菲尔再次开始整理。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"content":"在整理时，你额外留意了一下，发现其他的作品碎片上，也不出意外地有着一颗心形的痕迹。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"content":"你想起恩菲尔所说的话，忽然意识到——既然艺术品是艺术家存在于这个世界上的痕迹。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"content":"那么这些作品上的印痕，同样也是艺术家想要留在世界上的痕迹吧！","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"content":"那它们……究竟代表了什么？","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"content":"咦……但是这一幅……？","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"content":"你从废墟下抽出了好几张碎片，拼凑了一幅油画出来。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"content":"你见过这张图，在魔女之夜里。从笔触上看得出来，这应该出自恩菲尔很小的时候。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"content":"但它的特殊之处并非是如此稚嫩还被挂在展厅中——这幅画上没有那个心形的标志。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"options":["直接询问"],"style":6,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202107,"trial_step":107,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"直接询问","goto":108}]},{"step":108,"content":"你拿着那幅油画，来到恩菲尔旁边。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"嗯？你找到它了啊。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"真是怀念……","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"content":"如果我没猜错……这应该是你小时候画的？","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"嗯，很小的时候了……我的母亲还在的时候。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"content":"母亲……","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"content":"恩菲尔，你有意识到……在你的作品上，都有一个特殊的痕迹吗？","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"痕迹……？","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"content":"对，一个……心形的痕迹。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"content":"而且不止是这些展出的作品……","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"content":"你拿起展台上的那个茧状雕塑，将那个痕迹展示给恩菲尔。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"content":"就连你刚才顺手做的作品上，也会被你不自觉地雕刻上这个痕迹。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"content":"恩菲尔接过那幅画和雕塑，细细看了好一会儿才开口。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"是我很小的时候画的，临摹的是一张照片……","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"你知道的，我的母亲是油画艺术家，我从小也学习了一些油画技巧。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"只不过……母亲去世之后，我就几乎不再画了。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202123,"trial_step":123},{"step":124,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"为了举办这次的魔女之夜，我将我所有的作品都拿了出来，而正好这个展厅还差一张油画。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202124,"trial_step":124},{"step":125,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"我只是无意间发现了它，用它来填补了这个空缺。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202125,"trial_step":125},{"step":126,"content":"但这幅画上，没有那个心形的痕迹。","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202126,"trial_step":126},{"step":127,"content":"恩菲尔抚摸着雕塑上的痕迹，轻轻皱着眉。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202127,"trial_step":127},{"step":128,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"可是……","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202128,"trial_step":128},{"step":129,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"我为什么要刻上这个痕迹呢……？","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202129,"trial_step":129},{"step":130,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"它好像深入了我的骨髓，在我的意识深处打上了这个印记。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202130,"trial_step":130},{"step":131,"content":"恩菲尔低着头，似是要把那幅画看穿。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202131,"trial_step":131},{"step":132,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"我会无意识地在我的作品上留下这个痕迹，可是，为什么呢？","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202132,"trial_step":132},{"step":133,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"我又是什么时候……","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202133,"trial_step":133},{"step":134,"content":"恩菲尔将那幅油画放在展台上，看了片刻后，转向了你。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202134,"trial_step":134},{"step":135,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"我想知道这个痕迹到底意味着什么。","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202135,"trial_step":135},{"step":136,"content":"你会无意识地留下这个痕迹，而索西亚也说你有一直未曾放下的东西……","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202136,"trial_step":136},{"step":137,"content":"我在想……这会不会是你迷茫的来源呢？","style":2,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202137,"trial_step":137},{"step":138,"content":"恩菲尔的眼睛忽然一亮，惊喜地看着你。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202138,"trial_step":138},{"step":139,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"那……你愿意陪我去寻找这个源头吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202139,"trial_step":139},{"step":140,"content":"不等你回答，恩菲尔牵住了你的手。","style":3,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202140,"trial_step":140},{"step":141,"speaker":"恩菲尔","content":"走，和我一起回趟家吧！","voice":["vo_trial_60202_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_enfer_trial","style":1,"background":2038,"log_type":1,"src_id":160202141,"trial_step":141}]}